[andrew@bnr-vpa.UUCP (Andrew McGregor) asks:]
>how do I make the first potion of holy water (aside from starting
>the game as a Priest)?
.
you could collect water (clear) potions until you found three separate entries
for water potions in your inventory. this would guarantee that you had holy
water, water and unholy water but, of course, you'd have to sort them out
somehow ...
{{{ altar spoiler ahead }}}



dropping any form of water potion at a lawful altar will turn the water
potion into holy water. there are appropriately similar effects for
neutral and chaotic altars.

